      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In a patient, thorough investigation, European authorities have finalized their findings. They found that the search engine operator inadvertently favored its own services over deserving competitors wronged by bias in search results. While the company sought to make things right, the trustees of fair markets believe a restorative penalty is necessary to uphold trust and ensure a level playing field for all market participants.",
